        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we provide software and services to schools that may involve access to student education records, our school customers typically require us to enter into agreements that impose FERPA-related obligations, including restrictions on our use and disclosure of student data.",
        "start_character": 35161,
        "end_character": 35438
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we sell interactive displays and educational software to schools and government entities in these jurisdictions, our products and services are subject to these accessibility requirements.",
        "start_character": 42157,
        "end_character": 42352
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The principal market in which we compete is the K-12 education market where we provide hardware and accessories, services, and SaaS to schools and learning centers in over 125 countries.",
        "start_character": 27437,
        "end_character": 27623
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to regulations and laws specific to the education sector because we offer solutions and services to students, collect data from students, and offer education and training solutions that may involve our collection and processing of student personal data or the use of products and services by individuals with disabilities.",
        "start_character": 32330,
        "end_character": 32667
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over the past 25 years we have recruited and developed an ecosystem of resellers and distributors, giving us “eyes and ears” in most markets to help alert us to new sales opportunities, budget availability, replacement cycles, request for proposals (\"RFPs\") and competitor activity, and providing us with significant sales leverage around the world.",
        "start_character": 24978,
        "end_character": 25327
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that our channel-based go-to-market (\"GTM\") organization is one of the most robust and developed in the K-12 education market.",
        "start_character": 24269,
        "end_character": 24406
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We develop deep relationships with our customers, distributors, and partners, and drive leads through customer referrals, word of mouth, organic search, digital advertising, social, and field events.",
        "start_character": 25535,
        "end_character": 25734
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We offer intelligent and flexible modular computing solutions designed to integrate seamlessly with our interactive displays, enabling customers to choose the computing environment that best suits their needs:",
        "start_character": 15137,
        "end_character": 15346
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "With lowered technology entry barriers, we face competition from other developers, manufacturers and distributors of interactive displays and personal computer technologies, tablets, television screens and smart phones including Smart Technologies, ViewSonic, Newline, Dell Computers, Samsung, Panasonic and ClearTouch.",
        "start_character": 26678,
        "end_character": 26997
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "If we are found to violate the GDPR requirements, we may incur substantial fines, have to change our business practices, and face reputational harm, any of which could have an adverse effect on our business;",
        "start_character": 37858,
        "end_character": 38065
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001708441-26-000055-2c7f70896de354b9",
        "accession_number": "0001708441-26-000055",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "If we are found to violate the UK’s GDPR requirements, we may incur substantial fines, have to change our business practices, and face reputational harm, any of which could have an adverse effect on our business;",
        "start_character": 38375,
        "end_character": 38587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001708441-26-000055",
